            "review_text": "Connector16389951788\n2 contributions\n0\nThe kitchen at 165 is bad.\nAug 2026 • Family\nTonight my family ate in the kitchen at 165 Nguyen Quang Dai. I think it's worse than the foreign cuisine that I've experienced a lot in Lee. Rough, crowded, the dishes too salty, old fried beans and burning, salty rice, not serving tea as dessert as the other side.... Generally, it feels pretty bad. For a long time lead family to eat and experience lost real excitement.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten August 2, 2026",
