            "review_title": "Review at Bếp Của Ngoại",
            "review_text": "Derrick1230\nHong Kong, China1100 contributions\n1\nAuthentic Vietnamese cuisine… a local favorite of the locals…\nNov 2024 • Friends\nSo this is a favorite of the locals in Da Nang… while the food is good it’s very authentic Vietnamese cooking. The portions are smaller I found for the meat but is crazy cheap… 4 people, 4 beer, 4 water and too much food to eat for dinner it was $21.00 for the entire bill! I liked the fried fish, the crispy tofu, and the morning glory and the steamed vegetables and the pork ribs. The beer was room temperature so it took awhile to chill… I don’t think the staff speak much English so you better have google translate… they do have a flip picture menu in English…. We were the only foreigners on the night we had dinner…\nRead more\nWritten November 21, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
