            "review_text": "Jona04\nSingapore, Singapore71 contributions\n0\nMust try if you like local dishes\nMar 2024 • Friends\nFood is fantastic and the place is clean. Portions are small. Prices are reasonable. There is a small complimentary local dessert which was delicious. \n\nThey have a flip picture cards for tourists to make ordering easier.\nInsider tip:\nWalk-in only. Go before 12 noon or after 1.00 pm if you are planning to go for lunch.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 8, 2024",
